          "kicker": "Coaching commitment",
          "heading": "Jake White will move to live in Fiji from early 2027",
          "body": "Fiji head coach Jake White, who started last month, is all-in: he will move to live in Fiji in early 2027 and spend blocks of each year touring the islands, and plans to coach in schools and clubs. He beat strong competition for the role, and says timing won it for him. He also says no one in Fiji coaches the maul. The Fiji U18s and U20s will start touring South Africa every year."
        },
