          "kicker": "Community moment",
          "heading": "Midlothian five-year-old who overcame brain tumour delivers Scotland match ball",
          "body": "A young fan who has come through a brain tumour spent time with the Scotland squad before delivering the match ball. The five-year-old from Midlothian was buzzing to meet the players, and his visit lands on the day Scotland face Australia at Murrayfield. For a squad about to take the field, it is the kind of moment that puts the jersey in perspective."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "France beat South Africa 21-19, ending home losing streak to Springboks",
