          "heading": "Felipe Contepomi's Pumas face a heavily depleted France after Italy win",
          "body": "Argentina head into Round 6 of the Nations Championship off a 19-14 win over Italy, and Rugbyrama reports that France, though heavily depleted, are still determined to get a result. The Pumas are described as being in a tough spot after a difficult year. The last meeting, in November 2024, went France's way 37-23, and Argentina's most recent win in the fixture came in 2014, when Nicolás Sánchez kicked four drop goals."
