          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Les Kiss restores Carter Gordon and Rob Valetini to Wallabies starting XV",
          "body": "Playmaker Carter Gordon, back from a broken leg, and back-rower Rob Valetini are named in the starting XV for Scotland, with coach Les Kiss saying of Valetini, \"He’s going to make a difference, that’s for sure.\" Gordon was the incumbent before his injury against Argentina in September, and Kiss sees him as the man to nail down a No 10 jersey that has gone to seven different starting flyhalves since the last World Cup. Valetini returns to No 6 alongside Harry Wilson and Fraser McReight."
        },
